  "intro": "Howdy! We hope everyone is enjoying their summer. This sample issue shows everything the newsletter can hold — research briefs, upcoming events, funding opportunities, a roundup of recent education research, and the policy stories we follow. Poke around: nothing here is real, and nothing you do to it is permanent.",
